3.Noi dung chuan dau ra
3.1. Yeu cau ve kien thurc
a.Kien thirc chung:
- Nam vung kien thurc giao duc dai cuong ve phap luat, ly luan cua chu nghia Maxr-
Lenin, duong loi cach mang cua Dang Cong san Viet nam va tur turong Ho Chi Minh de
dinhhuongturtuongnhanthurcbanthan;
- Nam vung nhung kién thurc co ban va chung nhat ve khoa hoc tyr nhien, khoa hoc
xa hoi, nhan van va nghe thuat trong khung chuong trinh danh cho khoi cac nganh khoa
hoc xa hoi nhan van va nghe thuat de co the thiet ke nhung san pham co gia tri tham my,
van hoa va kinh te cao;
- Kha nang ngoai ngu (tieng Anh) turong duong chung chi B, va chung chi tin hoc
can ban A;
