b.Kienthircco.songanh:
DA
- Hieu ro ngon ngu tao hinh va nghe thuat thi giac (mau sac, hinh hoa, bo cuc) va
kha nang thyc hanh ve can ban de van dung vao thiet ké;
- Nam vung cac kien thurc co so nganh (Nguyen ly thi giac, Typography, cac phan
mem thiet ke,...) va kién thuc bo tro (Lap trinh) de hinh thanh nhan thurc tham my, phat
trien y turong, kha nang tu duy sang tao va mot so ky nang lap trinh can ban trong viec
thiet ke cac san pham do hoa urng dung;
c.Kienthircchuyennganh:
- C6 kien thurc chuyen sau ve nganh Thiet ke do hoa va Thiet ke da phuong tien; kha
nang van dung linh hoat va sang tao cac kien thurc nen tang, co so nganh va chuyen nganh
vao sang tac, thiet ke cac loai hinh do an khac nhau;
- Lam chu ngon ngu thiet ke do hoa va thiet ke da phuong tien, co the van dung vao
cac sang tac thiet ke phu hop voi thi hieu tham my tot. Co nen tang ngon ngur thit ké
truyen thong tot va kha nang tiep can xu huong thiet ke hien dai;
- Nam vung cac nguyen ly thiet ke, quy trinh, ky thuat va phuong phap sang tac,
thiét ke cac san pham do hoa va da phuong tien thuoc linh vyrc my thuat ung dung;
- Co kha nang phan tich xu huong tham my, tim kiém va phat trien y tuong moi trong
thiet ke do hoa; Co kha nang sang tac, hoan thien dy an thiét ke do hoa va thiét ke da
phuongtien co tinh tham myva ung dung cao;
3.2.Yeu cau ve ky nang
a.Kynangcirng:
-Lam ch cacvat lieu ve (chi,mau,chat lieu ve...)va sur dung mau sac de thyc hanh
nghien curu hinh hoa, xay dung bo cuc tao hinh va phac thao, thiét ke nhanh bang tay;
- Ky nang sur dung cac cong cu phan mem mem thiet ke do hoa 2D, 3D tren may tinh
lam cong cu the hien va trinh bay y tuong trong thiet ke;
- Nam duoc cac nguyen tac co ban cua lap trinh va van dung dugc cac phan mem lap
trinh vao thiét ke hoac co kha nang lap trinh cac ung dung lien quan den thiet ke da phurong
tien;
- Kha nang sir dung may anh va cac thiét bi quay phim, ghi hinh, tieng va cac thiét
bi dung phim, ky thuat xur ly hinh anh, am thanh ho tro trong qua trinh sang tac thiet ke;
- Co ky nang thanh thao, sang tao trong viec len y turong va thyc hien cac do an thiét
ké do hoa van hoa (truyen tranh, tranh co dong, sach, bao, tap chi, lich, tem,..) va do hoa
thuong mai (logo, quang cao, bao bi, an pham van phong, nhan dien thuong hieu,...).
- Co ky nang thanh thao, sang tao trong viec len y tuong va thyc hien cac do an thiét
ke da phuong tien (web, MV ca nhac, quang cao dong motion graphic, xay dung nhan vat
va moi truong game, lam phim phong su, phim ngan,...);
b.Kynangmem:
- Ky nang tyr hoc, nghien curu, phat hien va giai quyet cac van de chuyen mon trong
cacdieukien va hoan canh khacnhau;
JONG
- Ky nang lap ho so thiét ke, trinh bay do an, giai trinh va bao ve ket qua nghien curu,
sang tac, thiet ke; Ky nang giao tiep, dam phan, thuyet trinh dy an voi doi tac;
-Ky nang lam viec doc lap va lamviec nhom;
- Ky nang huong nghiep, tim viec lam va ty tao ra viec lam cho ban than va cho nguoi
khac;
3.3.Yeu cau vé thai do va hanh vi
- Lap truong tu turong vung vang, co pham chat dao durc tot va loi song lanh manh.
The luc surc khoe tot va nhan thurc dung dan ve an ninh quoc phong toan dan. Thyc hien
nghiem tuc duong loi chu chuong chinh sach cua Dang va phap luat cua Nha nuoc, cac
quy dinh lien quan den linh vuc van hoa nghe thuat, dac biet la luat ban quyen va so huru
tri tue;
- Tinh than say me sang tao, long yeu nghe; y thurc vi cong dong va bao ve moi truong;
Co y thurc cau thi, tim toi sang tao, thuong xuyen phan dau vuron lén nang cao trinh do
chuyen mon; Y thurc giu gin ban sac van hoa dan toc, biet phat huy cac gia tri truyen thong
va tiep thu, chon loc hoc tap tinh hoa nhan loai trong linh vurc thiet ke do hoa;
3.4. Vi tri lam viec cua nguoi hoc sau khi tot nghiep
- Sinh vien sau khi tot nghiep co the tham gia lam viec trong cac don vi tu van thiet
ke, cac co quan nha nuoc hoac cac doanh nghiep trong va ngoai nuoc lien quan den linh
vycdao tao,dap ungnhu cau phat trienkinh te-xa hoiva tham my cua doi songxa hoi;
- Co kha nang lam viéc doc lap, lam viec nhom hoac thanh lap doanh nghiep trong
cac linh vyc thiet ké; kha nang lam viec full-time, part-time hoac freelance voi cac doi tac
nurocngoai;
 - Co the tham gia giang day tai cac truong Dai hoc, Cao dang, Trung hoc chuyen
nghiep, day nghe trong linh vyc my thuat ung dung;
3.5.Kha nang hoc tap, nang cao trinh do sau khi ra truo'ng
- Co kha nang.ty hoc, tu nghien curu, trau doi chuyen mon nghe nghiep va nghien
curu khoa hoc, tham dy cac workshop trong nuoc va quoc te;
- Co du trinh do de hoc bang dai hoc thu 2 cua cac chuyen nganh lien quan va hoc
sau dai hoc (Thac sy, Tien sy) chuyen nganh thiét ke tai cac truong dai hoc trong va ngoai
nuoc;
